<title>USA: Parlux knows no reason for stock pressure.</title>
<headline>Parlux knows no reason for stock pressure.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parlux Fragrances Inc said on Thursday that it does not know of &quot;any unusual occurrence, activity or negative news&quot; that has pressured its stock to below-industry levels.</p>
<p>The stock closed on Wednesday at 4 3/8 and was trading around 5 1/8 early on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said its board has authorized chief executive Ilia Lekach to pursue reasonable actions to enhance shareholder value.</p>
